{"actor":"GroundTruth","meta":{},"op":"note","params":{"text":"flatten.py NOW HAS a location check (terraform/locations.py), so Main's blocking requirement is satisfied on the flatten side: live LocationProxy markers are authoritative for POSITION and the mod-free seedscan dump supplies the per-type radius by exact position match, worst case (32 m, the largest declared radius in the world) for any marker the dump cannot identify. MEASURED over the 24 zones the experiment generated: 1 of 4 live markers matched the dump at d=0.00 m (WoodHouse2) and 3 did not appear in it at all, i.e. modded POIs. Stand-off = max(exteriorRadius, interiorRadius) MEASURED + 11 m overshoot INFERRED from one observation + 15 m margin (taste), measured to the pad RECTANGLE not its centre. Refusal measured to fire on the pad that suffered the defect."},"prev":"01e6200bca70b6649370a61d626dfcd89b529869ff3859a6e9462a3d4c97ba73","requires":{},"seq":3,"ts":"2026-09-16T02:28:11Z","wire":[]}
